Spec: Todo Model

Purpose:
  Represent a single TODO item and protect its state transitions.

Owns:
  todo.js

Must:
  Expose id, title, and completed fields.
  Generate a unique id on creation.
  Provide a toggle method that flips completed state.
  Treat title as a non-empty string.

Must not:
  Access localStorage or any persistence layer.
  Import service or component code.
  Perform DOM operations.

Scenario: toggle completed
  Given a todo with completed = false
  When toggle is called
  Then completed becomes true

Scenario: toggle back
  Given a todo with completed = true
  When toggle is called
  Then completed becomes false

Done when:
  Todo instances carry id, title, and completed.
  Toggle correctly flips completed state.
  No persistence or DOM imports exist.
